@prometheusBaseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:9090

# ConferenceProFlow M4.3D2 — READ ONLY Prometheus HTTP API probes.
# Open from Visual Studio; use Send Request on individual GET queries.
# Most custom metrics appear only AFTER apps start, process events and OTLP export runs.
# Default name translation: dots -> underscores; Counter -> _total; seconds histograms -> _seconds_count.
# Do not paste Prometheus API JSON that contains sensitive labels or connection details.

### 00 — Prometheus self-scrape (backend health only)
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=up%7Bjob%3D%22prometheus%22%7D

### 01 — Registration HTTP duration count
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=http_server_request_duration_seconds_count

### 02 — Resource service metadata (after application export)
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=target_info

### 03 — Outbox backlog snapshot: three pipelines
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_outbox_backlog_pending

### 04 — Oldest pending message age
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_outbox_backlog_oldest_age_seconds

### 05 — Finalized registrations by outcome
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_registration_finalized_total

### 06 — Outbox publishing outcomes
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_outbox_publish_outcomes_total

### 07 — Allocation Inbox processing attempts
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_allocation_inbox_processing_attempts_total

### 08 — Analytics Kafka processing attempts
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_analytics_kafka_handling_attempts_total

### 09 — Analytics Kafka offset commits
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_analytics_kafka_offset_commit_attempts_total

### 10 — Registration finalization histogram count
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_registration_finalization_duration_seconds_count

### 11 — Outbox publish duration histogram count
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_outbox_publish_duration_seconds_count

### 12 — Allocation Inbox duration histogram count
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_allocation_inbox_processing_duration_seconds_count

### 13 — Analytics Kafka duration histogram count
GET {{prometheusBaseUrl}}/api/v1/query?query=conferenceproflow_analytics_kafka_handling_duration_seconds_count

